{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And in Kings</b> (2 Kings 19:14): ויקראם על הספרים [\"and he spread them out upon the documents\"]. And in Isaiah (Isaiah 37:14): ויקראהו על הספר [\"and he spread it out upon the document\"] — alone, for there the reproaches are. And in both books: ויפרשהו [\"and he spread it out\"]."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:47.596330673Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}